# Generated masters: 2K PNGs, 5-8 MB each.
#
# They are the input to optimise.sh, not something the site serves - the page
# loads the WebP in assets/img/ instead. Regenerate with generate.sh; the
# prompts are the reproducible part, not the pixels.
*.png

# Same intent as *.png above, for the formats the OG card pipeline emits.
# assets/gen holds MASTERS — whatever the generator returned, at whatever size
# it returned it. Only the optimised derivative in assets/img ships, and only
# that derivative is worth versioning.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
